# STM32H7 boot/connect smoke test. Brings up the Renode stm32h7
# backend end-to-end: the local stm32h723.repl (inheriting upstream
# stm32h743.repl, since Renode ships no h723) plus upstream
# Miscellaneous.STM32H7_RCC is the H7-specific path - distinct from the
# F1 (local rcc_stub), F4 (STM32F4_RCC) and G0 paths. printers.test
# reaches H7 chips via Octopus-Pro-H723 / Kraken-class boards at
# config-parse depth; this is the firmware-boot regression target.
# Uses the stm32h723 build.
DICTIONARY stm32h723.dict
CONFIG stm32h7_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR stm32h7_smoke.fixture.json

M114
M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
